@startuml
title Diagrama de Secuencia: Registro e Inicio de Sesión

actor Usuario
boundary "Interfaz Angular" as UI
control "AuthController" as API
control "AuthService" as Service
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

== Registro ==
Usuario -> UI: Ingresar datos de registro
UI -> API: POST /auth/register (UserDTO)
API -> Service: register(UserDTO)
Service -> DB: checkEmailExists()
DB --> Service: No existe
Service -> Service: encodePassword(BCrypt)
Service -> DB: save(User)
DB --> Service: UserSaved
Service --> API: Success
API --> UI: 201 Created
UI --> Usuario: Registro Exitoso

== Inicio de Sesión ==
Usuario -> UI: Ingresar Credenciales
UI -> API: POST /auth/login (LoginDTO)
API -> Service: authenticate(LoginDTO)
Service -> DB: findByEmail()
DB --> Service: UserData
Service -> Service: validatePassword()
Service -> Service: generateJWTToken(Roles)
Service --> API: AuthResponse(Token)
API --> UI: 200 OK (JWT)
UI -> UI: Store Token in LocalStorage
UI --> Usuario: Redirección a Dashboard
@enduml
